                <mxCell id="t11" parent="1" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=17;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#333333" value="&lt;b&gt;ARCH_10&lt;/b&gt; — Build 10 (M1.5): passkeys. Sign in with a phone or laptop passkey (WebAuthn) beside the admin password, which always keeps working. The relying party comes from DEVCULES_PUBLIC_URL, so passkeys work on https names and http://localhost, never on an IP address." vertex="1">
