                <mxCell id="t16" parent="1" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=17;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#333333" value="&lt;b&gt;ARCH_15&lt;/b&gt; — Build 15 (M3.1): the Devcules MCP server. Agents call POST /mcp with their launch token and get read-only tools that show Devcules itself. It speaks the new stateless MCP (2026-07-28) and the older handshake versions on the same endpoint." vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry height="60" width="1090" x="40" y="30" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
